OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police officer denies
OL,4,Araping woman while on duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former South Wales Police officer has
OL,7,Fdenied raping and strangling a woman in
OL,8,FSwansea while on duty.
OL,10,FRikki Hall appeared at Bristol Crown
OL,11,FCourt to enter pleas on four charges
OL,12,Fthat are linked to his time as a police
OL,13,Fconstable.
OL,15,FThe 33-year-old, of Tennyson Way,
OL,16,FSwansea, pleaded not guilty to two
OL,17,Fcounts of rape as well as a charge of
OL,18,Fintentional strangulation of a woman,
OL,19,Fall relating to an alleged incident in
OL,20,FFebruary 2024.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
