OL,3,GNEWSAFormer police officer denies
OL,4,Araping woman while on duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also pleaded not guilty to
OL,7,Fmisconduct in public office by
OL,8,F"engaging in sexual activity with a
OL,9,Fmember of the public who you had met
OL,10,Fwhile carrying out welfare and
OL,11,Fsafeguarding checks".
